/-!
# Dependent-origination non-quantum core spine v1.5

This aggregate keeps the parent dependent-origination architecture independent
of quantum, Choi, Hamiltonian, spectral-gap, and physical Yang--Mills layers.

The structural spine is now:

```text
context-valued functorial transport
-> system maps / reindexing / reversible specializations
-> finite history and explicit memory
-> contextual descent and refinement transitivity
-> directed and filtered refinement categories
-> cofinal-invariant semantics
-> explicit typed two-cells between refinement paths
-> two-cell root coherence instead of strict root-path equality
-> eventual two-cell coherence instead of eventual path equality
-> set-truncated realization only by explicit two-cell invariance
```

The v1.5 layer is the first higher-categorical rung.  It deliberately does not
claim a full strict 2-category, bicategory, infinity-category, stack, or higher
stack.  In particular, the two-cell carrier records identities, vertical
composition, and whiskering but does not yet impose the complete coherence-law
package required for those stronger structures.

Strict v1.4 filtered refinement remains available exactly as the equality
2-cell specialization.
-/

end KUOS.DependentOriginationCoreSpineV1_5
